   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="ambiguous_atom_chem_shift.ambiguous_shift_set_id">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#ambiguous_atom_chem_shiftItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int"/>
      <rdfs:label>ambiguous_atom_chem_shift.ambiguous_shift_set_id</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

An integer value that defines a set of chemical shifts that form a mutually
ambiguous group. For ambiguity codes of 4 or 5, various combinations of assigned
chemical shifts may form sets where the chemical shift assignments are not
specifically known, but it is known that the chemical shifts belong to one atom
in the set.
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tagdetail.php?tag=_Ambiguous_atom_chem_shift.Ambiguous_shift_set_ID"/>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
