   <owl:Class rdf:ID="angle">
      <rdfs:label>angle</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

Items in the angle category define a unique identifier for each angle described by three linked atoms in the molecular assembly.

         </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tag.php?tagcat=Angle"/>
