   <owl:Class rdf:ID="atom_nomenclature">
      <rdfs:label>atom_nomenclature</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

Items in the atom_nomenclature category define alternative atom nomenclature for the atoms in a chemical compound.

         </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tag.php?tagcat=Atom_nomenclature"/>
