      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      <rdfs:label>atom_site.pdbx_label_atom_id</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

Atom identifier assigned by the PDB and extracted from the PDB entry.

HB1
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tagdetail.php?tag=_Atom_site.PDBX_label_atom_ID"/>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="atom_site.pdbx_label_comp_id">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#atom_siteItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      <rdfs:label>atom_site.pdbx_label_comp_id</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

Chemical component identifier assigned by the PDB and extracted from the
