A value indicating the confidence in the assigned coordinate values for
this atom.

0.84
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tagdetail.php?tag=_Atom_site.Uncertainty"/>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
