The units used for the reported relaxation values.

s; s-1; ms
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tagdetail.php?tag=_Auto_relaxation_list.Relaxation_val_units"/>
