The substance ID code assigned to the compound by the PubChem database.

33768
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tagdetail.php?tag=_Chem_comp.PubChem_code"/>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="chem_comp.release_status">
