               </rdf:List>
            </owl:oneOf>
         </owl:DataRange>
      </rdfs:range>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

Chemical components can be of two molecular types either a complete chemical
compound or a fragment of a complete chemical compound.

L-peptide linking
                        </rdfs:comment>
