X-ray crystallography) that was used to collect the data in the entry at the database
listed.

NMR
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tagdetail.php?tag=_Chem_comp_db_link.Entry_experimental_method"/>
