   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="conformer_stat_list_rep.stats_not_available">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#conformer_stat_list_repItem"/>
      <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="#conformer_stat_list_rep"/>
      <rdfs:range>
         <owl:DataRange>
            <owl:oneOf>
               <rdf:List>
                  <rdf:first rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">yes</rdf:first>
                  <rdf:rest>
                     <rdf:List>
                        <rdf:first rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">no</rdf:first>
                        <rdf:rest rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil"/>
                     </rdf:List>
                  </rdf:rest>
               </rdf:List>
            </owl:oneOf>
         </owl:DataRange>
      </rdfs:range>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

Depositors are strongly encouraged to enter a few statistical parameters
regarding the deposited representative conformer. If these data are not available,
please check the box provided. After checking the box and clicking on the 'save'
button, the statistical fields will no longer be marked as mandatovy and you
will be able to complete and submit your deposition.

yes/no
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tagdetail.php?tag=_Conformer_stat_list_rep.Stats_not_available"/>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
