   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="constraint_stat_list_rep.amb_intermol_dist_rmsd">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#constraint_stat_list_repItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
      <rdfs:label>constraint_stat_list_rep.amb_intermol_dist_rmsd</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

Root mean squared deviation calculated over the ambiguous intermolecular
distance constraint violations for the representative conformer.
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tagdetail.php?tag=_Constraint_stat_list_rep.Amb_intermol_dist_rmsd"/>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
