      <rdfs:label>dist_constraint_tree.node_id</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

Nodes with logic only do not need to be listed here. Combined atoms into
pseudo atoms (e.g. LEU QG for all 6 protons) is preferred to keep this loop limited.

1
                     </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tagdetail.php?tag=_Dist_constraint_tree.Node_ID"/>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
