   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="gen_dist_constraint.member_id">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#gen_dist_constraintItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int"/>
      <rdfs:label>gen_dist_constraint.member_id</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

Unique identifier for a member of a constraint defined by the value to
the tag '_Gen_dist_constraint.ID'. For distance constraints with ambiguity that
is related by a logical operator (or, and, etc.), the constraint will have two or
more members.
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tagdetail.php?tag=_Gen_dist_constraint.Member_ID"/>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="gen_dist_constraint.member_logic_code">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#gen_dist_constraintItem"/>
      <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="#gen_dist_constraint"/>
      <rdfs:range>
         <owl:DataRange>
            <owl:oneOf>
               <rdf:List>
                  <rdf:first rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">OR</rdf:first>
                  <rdf:rest>
                     <rdf:List>
                        <rdf:first rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">AND</rdf:first>
                        <rdf:rest rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil"/>
                     </rdf:List>
                  </rdf:rest>
               </rdf:List>
            </owl:oneOf>
         </owl:DataRange>
      </rdfs:range>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

Code that defines the logical relationship (or, and, etc.) between the
