   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="peak_char.bounding_box_lower_val">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#peak_charItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
      <rdfs:label>peak_char.bounding_box_lower_val</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

The upper chemical shift value in the defined spectral dimension for a
bounding box used to define the region of the NMR spectrum that contains the observed
peak.
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tagdetail.php?tag=_Peak_char.Bounding_box_lower_val"/>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="peak_char.bounding_box_range_val">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#peak_charItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
      <rdfs:label>peak_char.bounding_box_range_val</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

Range value for a bounding box used to define the region of a NMR spectrum
where an observed peak is located, when the bounding box is defined by a range
in chemical shift centered on the peak chemical shift.
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tagdetail.php?tag=_Peak_char.Bounding_box_range_val"/>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
