      <rdfs:label>rdc_list.dipolar_constraint_calib_method</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

Method used to calibrate the values for the residual dipolar coupling constraints.
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tagdetail.php?tag=_RDC_list.Dipolar_constraint_calib_method"/>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="rdc_list.general_order_param_int_motions">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#rdc_listItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
      <rdfs:label>rdc_list.general_order_param_int_motions</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

The residual dipolar coupling provides geometric information relative to
a common alignment frame. The value for the item General_order_param_int_motions
is S, the local order parameter for internal motions.
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tagdetail.php?tag=_RDC_list.General_order_param_int_motions"/>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="rdc_list.mol_align_tensor_axial_sym_mol">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#rdc_listItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
      <rdfs:label>rdc_list.mol_align_tensor_axial_sym_mol</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

The residual dipolar coupling provides geometric information relative to
a common alignment frame. The value for the item Mol_align_tensor_axial_sym_mol
is the axial symmetric component of the alignment tensor (1/3(Azz-(Axx+Ayy)/2).
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tagdetail.php?tag=_RDC_list.Mol_align_tensor_axial_sym_mol"/>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
