   <owl:Class rdf:ID="sample_condition_citation">
      <rdfs:label>sample_condition_citation</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

Items in the sample_condition_citation category provide links to the citations category where reference citations with information about a set of sample conditions and their use can be found.

         </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tag.php?tagcat=Sample_condition_citation"/>
      <rdfs:subClassOf>
         <owl:Class>
            <owl:intersectionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
               <owl:Class rdf:about="#CategoryElement"/>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#sample_condition_citation.citation_id"/>
                  <owl:minCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:minCardinality>
