   <owl:Class rdf:ID="sample_condition_variable">
      <rdfs:label>sample_condition_variable</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

Items in the sample_condition_variable category define specific sample conditions like temperature or pH and the values for the sample conditions used in collecting experimental data.

         </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tag.php?tagcat=Sample_condition_variable"/>
