   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="spectral_transition_char.bounding_box_lower_val">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#spectral_transition_charItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
      <rdfs:label>spectral_transition_char.bounding_box_lower_val</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

The upper chemical shift value in the defined spectral dimension for a
bounding box used to define the region of the NMR spectrum that contains the observed
spectral transition.
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tagdetail.php?tag=_Spectral_transition_char.Bounding_box_lower_val"/>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
