   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="spin_system_link.offset">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#spin_system_linkItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int"/>
      <rdfs:label>spin_system_link.offset</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

The difference in sequence number between the from and to spin system.
For example, if the 'from' spin system is ALA39 and the 'to' spin system is THR38
then the offset is -1.
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tagdetail.php?tag=_Spin_system_link.Offset"/>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
