   <owl:Class rdf:ID="theoretical_auto_relaxation_experiment">
      <rdfs:label>theoretical_auto_relaxation_experiment</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

Items in the theoretical_auto_relaxation_experiment category may provide pointers to the NMR experiments and samples modeled to generate the data for a set of reported theoretical auto relaxation data.

         </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tag.php?tagcat=Theoretical_auto_relaxation_experiment"/>
      <rdfs:subClassOf>
