   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="theoretical_coupling_constant.ambiguity_code_1">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#theoretical_coupling_constantItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      <rdfs:label>theoretical_coupling_constant.ambiguity_code_1</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

A code indicating the presence of ambiguity in the assignment of the atom
to the coupling constant value. This type of ambiguity can arise for geminal
groups like the glycine alpha protons and other methylene groups.
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tagdetail.php?tag=_Theoretical_coupling_constant.Ambiguity_code_1"/>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
