   <owl:Class rdf:ID="theoretical_heteronucl_noe_software">
      <rdfs:label>theoretical_heteronucl_noe_software</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

Items in the theoretical_heteronucl_NOE_software category provide pointers to the software category and methods category where descriptions of software applications and methods used to generate the theoretical heteronuclear NOE values can be found.

         </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tag.php?tagcat=Theoretical_heteronucl_NOE_software"/>
