   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="torsion_angle_constraint.combination_id">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#torsion_angle_constraintItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int"/>
      <rdfs:label>torsion_angle_constraint.combination_id</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

An identifier for a constraint item combination within a dihedral constraint.
Constraint items with the same constraint_.Combination_id must be part of
the same constraint. When calculating a constraint they are AND-ed together, while
contributions with different constraint.Combination_id (or none) are OR-ed.
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tagdetail.php?tag=_Torsion_angle_constraint.Combination_ID"/>
