The source of the constraints (e.g. 'noe', 'hbond', 'measured'.
                        </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://bmrb.io/dictionary/tagdetail.php?tag=_Torsion_angle_constraint_list.Constraint_type"/>
